+# 8 Turntable接口
+
+## 8.1 ITurntableController
+
+接口：
+
+```cpp id="p9x4mq"
+class ITurntableController
+{
+
+virtual bool initialize()=0;
+
+
+virtual bool move(
+const TurntableCommand&
+)=0;
+
